## Summary

I shipped the **`AnimatedMarker`** P4 Apple shared surface — a production-polished, native SwiftUI/MapKit parity of `web/src/components/maps/AnimatedMarker.tsx` — as 11 self-contained files (1,911 lines) under `apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/`.

**What it does (full web parity):** a pulsing, Reduce-Motion-aware, heading-aware live-position marker on a SwiftUI `Map` host that pans the camera **only when the fix leaves the visible bounds** (the verbatim `useMap` / `getBounds().contains` / `panTo` behaviour), with the web `color` default `#00b4d8` + arbitrary-hex parsing and the `hasCoords` guard. Bound through a P1/S8 state-holder (no networking in the view); renders **every** state (loading/empty/error/ready/stale/offline); all copy via the P1/S10 facade; VoiceOver labels on every control; `view.opened` emitted once (P1/S11).

**Verification — every in-scope, host-runnable gate GREEN (real output):**
- `swiftlint --strict`: **0 violations / 10 files**
- `swiftformat --lint`: **0/10 need formatting**
- placeholder gate: **COUNT=0**
- iOS-18-sim **and** macOS-15 SDK whole-module IRGen of the full surface (incl. `#Preview` + the MapKit host) under Swift 6 + `-strict-concurrency=complete`: **0 errors**
- Isolated `TeslaSync` testable module + **green 32/32 XCTest run** against the real symbols (this run also caught a real `throws` test bug, which I fixed — and the isolated compile caught a real `.annotationTitles` bug the crashing app build had masked)

**Whole-tree `xcodebuild build test` — DEFERRED (red not from this surface):** iOS is blocked by a **pre-existing Swift 6.3.2 IRGen compiler crash** in the unmodified, out-of-scope file `feature-views/AppearanceSettings.Controls.swift` (an `@isolated(any)` reabstraction-thunk codegen bug on a `Toggle` binding setter — demangled symbol, backtrace, and git-blame in the log; the pre-my-files baseline failed identically). macOS is blocked by an **environment dev-signing gap**. Zero errors originate in any `AnimatedMarker.*` file.

This matches the established repo disposition (`apps/macos-pending-verifications.md`, sibling `0185-MapTileLayer`): code-complete + all in-scope gates green ⇒ **`EXIT=0 / STATUS=DONE`**, committed as `3b01a7155` with a full evidence log.

